{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 4,
  "name": {
    "ja": "宝物庫",
    "en": "The Vault",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "FIND_ARTIFACT",
    "level": 30,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
    "reward": {
      "artifacts": [
        88, 76, 90, 93, 98, 101, 102, 103, 105, 106, 110, 113, 114, 116, 118, 119, 128, 136, 145,
        155, 167, 208, 213, 227, 228,
      ],
    },
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
        "questType": "FIND_ARTIFACT",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "街の外の蔵は小規模な要塞として使われていて、多くの貴重な品物が",
          "蓄えられていました。しかし今ではモンスターどもに占拠されてしまっています。",
          "まだ中にあるはずの伝説の武具を見つけ出し、我々の元に持ち帰って下さい！",
          "武具を拾った時点でクエスト達成となるでしょう。しかし、どの部屋にあるか",
          "分からないので、部屋を一つずつ見てまわって下さい。ここのモンスターは",
          "手強く、また罠もしかけられています。くれぐれも注意して下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The vault was used outside the town as a minor fortress and",
          "stored many valuable items.  It has since been overrun.  Please",
          "find the short sword known as Sting and return it to us!",
          "The moment you find the sword, your quest will be complete.",
          "While the sword could be in any of the chambers, only look",
          "through one at a time. The monsters here are strong and there are",
          "traps to be concerned with as well.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
        "questType": "KILL_ALL",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "町の外の蔵は小規模な要塞として使われていて、多くの貴重な品物が",
          "蓄えられていました。しかし今ではモンスターどもに占拠されてしまっています。",
          "多くの品物が失われましたが、せめて蔵だけでも取り返したいのです！",
          "蔵を占拠するモンスターを全て打ち倒してください。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The vault was used outside the town as a minor fortress and",
          "stored many valuable items.  It is now occupied by many monsters,",
          "and many items are lost. However, we want to get back at least",
          "the vault. Please kill all monsters in the vault.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
        "questType": "FIND_ARTIFACT",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["その武器はお持ち下さい。これからの冒険の助けになるでしょう。"],
        "en": ["Please keep the weapon, it will aid you in your future quests."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
        "questType": "KILL_ALL",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["蔵の物品はお礼にお持ちください。空いた蔵は演劇場にしようと思います。"],
        "en": ["Please keep the items, it will aid you in your future quests."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
        "questType": "FIND_ARTIFACT",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "あの武器を見つけられなかったのですか？おそらく、モンスターどもが持っていって",
          "しまったんでしょうな。とても残念です。アレはこの街から悪を一掃する",
          "のにとても役に立ったでしょうに。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "You didn't find the weapon? Well, the monsters have probably",
          "carried it away.  Too bad, it would have been quite helpful",
          "in driving the evil out of our town.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
        "questType": "KILL_ALL",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["なんてことだ…もう蔵を取り戻す術はないのか…？"],
        "en": ["Too bad, we can not get back the vault forever......?"],
      },
    },
  ],
